{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sB13WhAiOh1795596597.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>海關瓦解一個大型私煙及洗黑錢集團，檢獲約3,200萬支懷疑走私香煙，約值1.4億元，拘捕五人。</p><p></p><p>行動中檢獲大批懷疑走私香煙、港幣現鈔、電腦、手提電話、公司印章，以及海運和銀行文件。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CUSTOMS-1200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VG6zl5D2gU1795587980.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>海關表示，去年9至10月截獲七個由韓國抵港貨櫃，報稱載有金屬及服裝等，實際藏有約3,100萬支私煙。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CUSTOMS-1200_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tzHU6iYwiK1795587977.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>調查後鎖定一個本地私煙集團，今年1月至3月再採取拘捕行動，先後拘捕5名男女，包括集團主腦，相信已瓦解有關集團。海關相信集團透過公司戶口清洗約930萬元犯罪得益。五名被捕人士現正保釋候查，不排除有更多人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:43:55.814682+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":245,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T04:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T01:31:49.046073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:37:20.236860+00:00","content_hash":"26e5e4565073f75cb7b9891af83daea13d32c6865c1ce82c3f78e992ab1fc990","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:43:55.814682+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}